			\bigsqcup\stackengine{-0pt}{\!}{\SavedStyle\!^{\mathord{\uparrow}}}{O}{l}{F}{T}{S}}}\,}_{q'<q}I_{q'}$. Further, using the explicit description of the opens in~\cite{Vi8}, one easily verifies that $\phi$ is indeed an epimorphism.

